    "text": "Dianna Russini has won over viewers with her personality and genuine approach on television. As her career continues to flourish, fans are growing curious about her personal life. So, who is Russini’s husband, Kevin Goldschmidt?In this article, we will discuss Dianna Russini’s husband, Kevin Goldschmidt, and their relationship history.Who is Dianna Russini married to?Dianna Russini is married to Kevin Goldschmidt.The NFL podcast Scoop City has drawn in twice the number of female listeners compared to other shows on the platform. Host Dianna Russini attributes this to a few key reasons. These include the podcast’s friendly tone, the recent surge in interest among young women in football, and Russini’s honest portrayal of her journey as a woman in the sports world.What is Kevin Goldschmidt’s job?Currently, Kevin Goldschmidt holds the position of senior manager at Shake Shack.Kevin Goldschmidt, born in Pennsylvania on June 6, 1985, has largely maintained a low profile. Raised in New York, he pursued higher education and graduated with a bachelor’s degree in finance from Penn State University in 2007.Dianna Russini and Kevin Goldschmidt’s relationship historyDianna Russini and Kevin Goldschmidt began their relationship in 2015. However, the couple chose to keep their relationship out of the public eye for several years. In July 2020, Russini shared news of their engagement on social media, making their relationship widely known. Later that same year, during the Covid-19 pandemic, the couple married in a low-key, socially distanced wedding and intimate ceremony.How many kids do Dianna Russini and Kevin Goldschmidt have?Dianna Russini and Kevin Goldschmidt welcomed their first child, Michael Andrew, on August 8, 2021. Two years later, the couple expanded their family with the birth of their second son, Joey. Russini shared the exciting news on Instagram. She announced Joey’s arrival on October 11, 2023, with the joyful message: “We had a baby… again!”The post